message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Response of Indian Iron and Steel Companies Towards Biodiversity: An LLM-Based Assessment of Corporate Biodiversity Disclosures and Alignment with the Global Biodiversity Framework"
abstract: >-
  An LLM-based framework for evaluating corporate biodiversity
  disclosures in the Indian iron and steel sector. Biodiversity-related
  statements are extracted from the FY2024-25 annual and sustainability
  reports of 100 companies, classified as Goals, Commitments or SMART
  Targets, and mapped to the 23 targets of the Kunming-Montreal Global
  Biodiversity Framework. Sector materiality is derived from the ENCORE
  framework and combined into a Biodiversity Disclosure Index.
type: software
